{
  "id": "ch03_s07_yeting",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "songhuizhen",
    "adi",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "两人的日常按自己的约定交接，不等待候选人的胜负",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "灶下木柴劈啪响了一声。阿荻将两只空桶倒扣，桶底还淌着水。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l2",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "小的靠里放，明早那个新来的抬不动大桶。别等她抬到门口才换。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l3",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "搬过了。这个底有缝，另记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l4",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可以记破损，不能仍作完好交。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l5",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就别让它完好。拿来，我看一眼。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l6",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋蹲下，指甲沿桶底划过。阿荻扶着桶，没有扶她起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l7",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "泡涨也合不上了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l8",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "记今天发现的。前头是不是就漏，我不知道，不能替上一班答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l9",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这句照记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l10",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋掸掉膝上的灰，把针包的扣结紧了紧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l11",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我明日不来。说好的两回带班已带完，饭也不用多留我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l12",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不等殿上散了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l13",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她们散她们的。我有人等着吃饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l14",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那桶就少洗一个。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l15",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐收好交凭。阿荻拿起饭勺，把锅边结住的一圈米刮了下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s07_yeting.l16",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "留那块给我。路上嚼。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch03_s08_hanyuan"
}
